        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Brass Egg Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful classic egg shaped cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes mounting hardware for easy installation. It brings a touch of classical hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece or drawer. Solid brass construction allows for years of use while still looking great. We offer 7 different finishes for this cabinet knob, but no matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be high quality solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KE125-Specifications.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"358\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KE125 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet egg knob can be combined with either the <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc100\"><b>1\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-1-2-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc150\"><b>1-1/2\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> for that extra decorative level. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KE125 Egg Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KE125.pdf?v=1704262157\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KE125 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually<i>\r\n</p>",
