                "description": "Egg Cabinet Knob Deltana KE125 - This beautiful classic egg shaped cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes mounting hardware for easy installation. It brings a touch of classical hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece or drawer. We offer 7 different finishes for this cabinet knob, but no matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be high quality solid brass.\r\n",
